# ── Obsidian ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local-only trash (deleted notes before the permanent trash)
.trash/

# ── Cloned third-party tool repos living inside the vault
#    (your own notes for these stay; the repos themselves don't) ─
#    Add a line per cloned project, e.g.:
#    6.Tools_info/1.Reconn/Sub-Domain_Hunting/Sublist3r/

# ─── OPTIONAL: comment this OUT if you DO want PDFs tracked ──
# ── Reference PDFs (large / not your own content) ────────
# Uncomment to stop tracking books & handbooks:
# *.pdf
